        {
          "offset": "0x548",
          "text": "\r\n        <html>\r\n        <body text=\"#302405\" topmargin=\"20\" leftmargin=\"15\"  speed=\"50\"><table><tr><td width=\"10\"> </td><td width=\"320\">\r\n          <p>好的装备要用好魔石配，才能相得益彰。</p>\r\n          <p> </p>\r\n          <p>有时候看到一些上等的武器上镶的却是劣质的魔石，我真是觉得心痛不已。</p>\r\n          <p> </p>\r\n          <p>我可以随时帮您去除魔石，要想换魔石的话，可千万别犹豫。</p>\r\n        </td><td width=\"10\"> </td></tr></table><p> </p><img src=\"textures/ui/basic_sep1.dds\" width=\"340\" height=\"2\"><p>&nbsp</p><p><button href=\"NpcFunc37\" icon=\"v4_npc_func_removeoption\" font_xml=\"v3_trade_button\" width=\"340\" height=\"32\"  align=\"center\" skin=\"v4_npcdlg_func_button\" >去除魔石</button></p><p>&nbsp</p><p><button href=\"QuestSelect4113\" icon=\"v4_npcdlg_quest_givable\" font_xml=\"v3_sel_button\" width=\"340\" height=\"28\" align=\"left\" skin=\"v4_npcdlg_sel_button\">43级 新任务：[魔石批量交换]比洛加的魔石袋</button></p><p><button href=\"QuestSelect4114\" icon=\"v4_npcdlg_quest_givable\" font_xml=\"v3_sel_button\" width=\"340\" height=\"28\" align=\"left\" skin=\"v4_npcdlg_sel_button\">43级 新任务：[魔石批量交换]比洛加的魔石包袱</button></p><p><button href=\"QuestSelect4072\" icon=\"v4_npcdlg_quest_givable\" font_xml=\"v3_sel_button\" width=\"340\" height=\"28\" align=\"left\" skin=\"v4_npcdlg_sel_button\">43级 新任务：[魔石交换]研究用魔石</button></p><p><button href=\"QuestSelect4073\" icon=\"v4_npcdlg_quest_givable\" font_xml=\"v3_sel_button\" width=\"340\" height=\"28\" align=\"left\" skin=\"v4_npcdlg_sel_button\">43级 新任务：[魔石交换]魔石的重新利用</button></p><p>&nbsp</p></body>\r\n        </html>\r\n    "
